im</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Sullivan</surname><given-names>PF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>TAMAL: an integrated approach to choosing SNPs for genetic studies of human complex traits</article-title><source>Bioinformatics</source><year>2006</year><volume>22</volume><fpage>626</fpage><lpage>627</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16418238</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B83"><label>83</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Xu</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Gregory</surname><given-names>SG</given-names></name><name><surname>Hauser</surname><given-names>ER</given-names></name></person-group><etal/><article-title>SNPselector: a web tool for selecting SNPs for genetic association studies</article-title><source>Bioinformatics</source><year>2005</year><volume>21</volume><fpage>4181</fpage><lpage>4186</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16179360</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back><floats-wrap><table-wrap id="T1" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Summary of application software and online tools related to digital candidate gene approach</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead valign="top"><tr><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Name</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Literature source</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Web Site</th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">GeneSeeker</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">van Driel MA, et al. Nucleic Acids Res. 2005;33:W758-61</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.cmbi.ru.nl/GeneSeeker/">http://www.cmbi.ru.nl/GeneSeeker/</ext-link></td></tr><tr><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">GFSST</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Zhang P, et al. BMC Bioinformatics. 2006; 7: 135</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><ext-l